---
flowchart TD
    Browser[Browser] -->|Sign in| Auth0[Auth0]
    Browser -->|Connect Fitbit| App[Next.js backend]
    App -->|Connected Accounts| Auth0
    Auth0 -->|OAuth authorization| Fitbit[Google Health API]
    App -->|Retrieve Fitbit token| Vault[Auth0 Token Vault]
    App -->|Read authorized data| Fitbit
    App -->|Show normalized report| Browser
    Browser -->|Choose sharing and generate| App
    App -->|Model request and summary tool| Fireworks[Fireworks]
    Fireworks -->|Suggestions through backend| Browser
    classDef browser fill:#f5f7fa,stroke:#596c84,color:#172b4d
    classDef backend fill:#eee9ff,stroke:#6a4ca5,color:#30204d
    classDef auth fill:#fff1e6,stroke:#a85c18,color:#5c3516
    classDef provider fill:#e8f5ed,stroke:#427856,color:#214b30
    class Browser browser
    class App backend
    class Auth0,Vault auth
    class Fitbit,Fireworks provider
